| Broker mock = broker-primary shipped | `mockBrokerClient.Produce` increments counter; no WAL, fsync, partition HA | In-process fake broker | `TestFault_BrokerShadowCutover_NoEventLoss`, `TestFault_BrokerLiveConsumer_*`; `ad_broker_ingest_divergence_high` quiet in shadow |
